# The site's own address, and the only thing it is used for is the share card: og:image and
# og:url have to be absolute, because a crawler that fetches the page has nothing to resolve a
# relative path against.
#
# **This value is the development one and is correct for it.** On the production build it must
# be the real domain, or a link pasted into WhatsApp will show no picture - exactly what
# happens today. Vite reads it at build time and substitutes it into index.html, so it has to
# be set before `npm run build`, not after.
VITE_SITE_URL=http://localhost:5173
